{"lines":{"10":{"character":"","next_id":"11","replacements":[],"text":"Leonnie est en effet chargé de décorer la ville pour Halloween, avec ses somptueuses citrouilles !","type":"dialogue"},"100":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"101","replacements":[],"text":"Mais où est l'ail semoule ?!","type":"dialogue"},"101":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"102","replacements":[],"text":"Je vois. Quelqu'un a décidé de jouer avec moi. Voyons comment lui renvoyer l'ascenseur !","type":"dialogue"},"102":{"next_id":"105","type":"goto"},"105":{"character":"","next_id":"106","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie est déterminée à éclaircir ce mystère avant qu'il puisse gâcher Halloween.","type":"dialogue"},"106":{"condition":null,"next_id":"107","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["106"],"text":"Aller voir en ville","type":"response"},"107":{"character":"","next_id":"108","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie, furibonde, part d'un pas décidé vers la ville pour tirer cette affaire au clair.","type":"dialogue"},"108":{"next_id":"111","type":"goto"},"11":{"next_id":"14","type":"goto"},"111":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"112","type":"mutation"},"112":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"113","type":"mutation"},"113":{"character":"","next_id":"114","replacements":[],"text":"Devant Léonnie se dresse une petite apocalypse.","type":"dialogue"},"114":{"character":"","next_id":"115","replacements":[],"text":"Des citrouilles partout ! Dans la rue, par les fenêtres...","type":"dialogue"},"115":{"character":"","next_id":"116","replacements":[],"text":"Les cucurbitacés semble s'être répamdus dans toute la ville !","type":"dialogue"},"116":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"117","replacements":[],"text":"Oh là là... Le Fantôme ne mentait pas !","type":"dialogue"},"117":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"118","replacements":[],"text":"Je peux choisir d'hyperventiler, ou bien réfléchir au problème...","type":"dialogue"},"118":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"119","replacements":[],"text":"Pourquoi pas les deux à la fois ? Non, voyons, respirons un bon coup.","type":"dialogue"},"119":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"120","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme a dit qu'il avait du mal à se souvenir de quelque chose.","type":"dialogue"},"120":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"121","replacements":[],"text":"Donc, on sait qu'il s'est passé quelque chose !","type":"dialogue"},"121":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"122","replacements":[],"text":"Je connais deux zigotos qui auraient probablement des réponses.","type":"dialogue"},"122":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"123","replacements":[],"text":"Je peux aller voir le Maire, toujours en train de manigancer quelque chose.","type":"dialogue"},"123":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"124","replacements":[],"text":"Et aussi Vampire, pas le dernier pour semer la zizanie !","type":"dialogue"},"124":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"125","replacements":[],"text":"Je vais commencer par...","type":"dialogue"},"125":{"condition":null,"next_id":"126","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["125","127"],"text":"Aller voir le Maire","type":"response"},"126":{"next_id":"131","type":"goto"},"127":{"condition":null,"next_id":"128","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"128":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"131":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"manoir\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"132","type":"mutation"},"132":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"133","type":"mutation"},"133":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"maire 40 20 0.7\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"134","type":"mutation"},"134":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasMeetMaire","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"149","next_id":"135","next_id_after":"149","type":"condition"},"135":{"character":"","next_id":"136","replacements":[],"text":"Le Maire du village est un joyeux luron. Parfois trop joyeux.","type":"dialogue"},"136":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"137","replacements":[],"text":"Ah Lélé ! Ca fait plaisir de te voir !","type":"dialogue"},"137":{"character":"","next_id":"138","replacements":[],"text":"Il a une facheuse tendance à donner des surnoms éclatés aux gens.","type":"dialogue"},"138":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"139","replacements":[],"text":"Haha, oui... Bonjour Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"139":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"140","replacements":[],"text":"Dis-donc Ninie, vous avez eu la main lourde cette année sur la potion !","type":"dialogue"},"14":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"15","type":"mutation"},"140":{"character":"","next_id":"141","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie fulmine.","type":"dialogue"},"141":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"142","replacements":[],"text":"Vous savez quoi ? Si vous réglez ça avant Halloween...","type":"dialogue"},"142":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"143","replacements":[],"text":"Je vous invite au resto ! Qu'est-ce que vous en dites ? Ca ne se refuse pas !","type":"dialogue"},"143":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"144","replacements":[],"text":"(Je veux disparaître...)","type":"dialogue"},"144":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"145","replacements":[],"text":"Ou alors, on disait qu'il n'y aurait pas de resto en échange ? Hein ?","type":"dialogue"},"145":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"146","replacements":[],"text":"Haha, Lénou quel humour ! J'adore !","type":"dialogue"},"146":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"147","replacements":[],"text":"(On règlera ça plus tard...)","type":"dialogue"},"147":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"148","replacements":[],"text":"Passons...","type":"dialogue"},"148":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasMeetMaire\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"149","type":"mutation"},"149":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasMaireIndice","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"153","next_id":"150","next_id_after":"156","type":"condition"},"15":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasDrinkTea","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"17","next_id":"16","next_id_after":"21","type":"condition"},"150":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"151","replacements":[],"text":"J'aurais voulu vous poser quelques question m'sieur le Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"151":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"152","replacements":[],"text":"Mais bien sûr Nilou ! Pour vous j'ai toujours le temps !","type":"dialogue"},"152":{"next_id":"162","type":"goto"},"153":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"156","next_id":"154","next_id_after":"156","type":"condition"},"154":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"155","replacements":[],"text":"Notre ami Fantôme est louche, c'est moi qui vous le dit !","type":"dialogue"},"155":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"156","replacements":[],"text":"Je l'ai vu s'introduire chez vous quand je suis passé admirer les citrouilles.","type":"dialogue"},"156":{"condition":null,"next_id":"157","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["156","158"],"text":"Retourner voir Fantôme","type":"response"},"157":{"next_id":"292","type":"goto"},"158":{"condition":null,"next_id":"159","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"159":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"16":{"character":"","next_id":"21","replacements":[],"text":"Mais rien ne presse...","type":"dialogue"},"162":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"manoir\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"163","type":"mutation"},"163":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"164","type":"mutation"},"164":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"maire 35 15 0.85\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"165","type":"mutation"},"165":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"166","replacements":[],"text":"De quoi vouliez-vous parler ?","type":"dialogue"},"166":{"condition":null,"next_id":"167","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["166","171","204","210","212"],"text":"Parler beau temps","type":"response"},"167":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"168","replacements":[],"text":"Beau temps n'est-ce pas ? L'Automne, le soleil...","type":"dialogue"},"168":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"169","replacements":[],"text":"Les citrouilles qui se baladent... Vous êtes sûre de ne rien pouvoir faire à ce sujet ?","type":"dialogue"},"169":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"170","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, bon... Parlons d'autre chose.","type":"dialogue"},"17":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"21","next_id":"18","next_id_after":"21","type":"condition"},"170":{"next_id":"162","type":"goto"},"171":{"condition":null,"next_id":"172","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Parler voyages","type":"response"},"172":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"173","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai entendu dire que vous étiez féru de voyages !","type":"dialogue"},"173":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"174","replacements":[],"text":"Ah oui ? Qui vous en a parlé ?","type":"dialogue"},"174":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"175","replacements":[],"text":"Vous, à chaque fois que je vous croise. Vous parlez beaucoup de vous.","type":"dialogue"},"175":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"176","replacements":[],"text":"Haha ! Je pourrais croire que vous vous lassez de nos conversations !","type":"dialogue"},"176":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"177","replacements":[],"text":"Heureusement que je vous connais.","type":"dialogue"},"177":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"178","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, heureusement...","type":"dialogue"},"178":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"179","replacements":[],"text":"Vous aimez loger chez l'habitant, me semble-t-il ?","type":"dialogue"},"179":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"180","replacements":[],"text":"Rien de mieux pour apprécier pleinement  la région que l'on visite !","type":"dialogue"},"18":{"character":"","next_id":"19","replacements":[],"text":"Rien ne presse, donc...","type":"dialogue"},"180":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"181","replacements":[],"text":"Et la prochaine fois, vous pourriez me demander avant de rentrer chez moi ?","type":"dialogue"},"181":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"182","replacements":[],"text":"Que ?! Enfin Lélé... On se connait mieux que ça !","type":"dialogue"},"182":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"183","replacements":[],"text":"Vous jurez ne pas être venu chez moi pendant mon absence ?","type":"dialogue"},"183":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"184","replacements":[],"text":"Alors là, croix de bois croix de fer, si je mens je vais en enfer !","type":"dialogue"},"184":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"185","replacements":[],"text":"Bon, étant un squelette ça ne m'engage pas trop, mais ma parole est ma parole !","type":"dialogue"},"185":{"condition":null,"next_id":"186","next_id_after":"193","replacements":[],"responses":["185","188"],"text":"S'excuser","type":"response"},"186":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"187","replacements":[],"text":"Très bien, je vous crois... Désolé d'avoir douté de vous.","type":"dialogue"},"187":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"193","replacements":[],"text":"Haha ! Ce n'est rien. D'autant que...","type":"dialogue"},"188":{"condition":null,"next_id":"189","next_id_after":"193","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Pester","type":"response"},"189":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"190","replacements":[],"text":"Mais il s'est passé quelque chose !","type":"dialogue"},"19":{"condition":null,"next_id":"20","next_id_after":"20","replacements":[],"responses":["19"],"text":"Aller voir les citrouilles","type":"response"},"190":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"191","replacements":[],"text":"Je ne rate pas mes potions moi monsieur !","type":"dialogue"},"191":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"192","replacements":[],"text":"Voyons Ninie, j'ai mes défauts mais je n'aime pas mentir.","type":"dialogue"},"192":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"193","replacements":[],"text":"D'autant que vous n'avez pas tort.","type":"dialogue"},"193":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"194","replacements":[],"text":"Quelqu'un est effectivement passé chez vous.","type":"dialogue"},"194":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"195","replacements":[],"text":"Comment ?! Qui donc ??","type":"dialogue"},"195":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasMaireIndice\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"196","type":"mutation"},"196":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"197","replacements":[],"text":"Notre ami tout de drap vêtu ! Je ne sais pas quel projet menait-il.","type":"dialogue"},"197":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"198","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme est entré chez moi ?? Mais pourquoi donc ?!","type":"dialogue"},"198":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"199","replacements":[],"text":"Je ne saurais dire, j'étais venu contempler les citrouilles, figurez-vous !","type":"dialogue"},"199":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"200","replacements":[],"text":"C'est un mystère dont je serais ravi de discuter autour de chandelles, Lélé !","type":"dialogue"},"2":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"3","type":"mutation"},"20":{"next_id":"32","type":"goto"},"200":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"201","replacements":[],"text":"Mais quel enfer...","type":"dialogue"},"201":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"202","replacements":[],"text":"Encore un surnom, Maire, et il faudra une fouille archéologique pour retrouver tous vos os !","type":"dialogue"},"202":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"203","replacements":[],"text":"Mais, enfin...","type":"dialogue"},"203":{"next_id":"131","type":"goto"},"204":{"condition":null,"next_id":"205","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Parler tendances","type":"response"},"205":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"206","replacements":[],"text":"Il parait que les Pin's sont de retour à la mode !","type":"dialogue"},"206":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"207","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, moi-même j'en ai un à mon effigie. Je l'adore !","type":"dialogue"},"207":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"208","replacements":[],"text":"C'est vous que vous adorez, Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"208":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"209","replacements":[],"text":"Eh bien... Oui, c'est juste !","type":"dialogue"},"209":{"next_id":"162","type":"goto"},"21":{"condition":null,"next_id":"22","next_id_after":"29","replacements":[],"responses":["21","28"],"text":"Boire une lampée","type":"response"},"210":{"condition":null,"next_id":"211","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"211":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"212":{"condition":null,"next_id":"213","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Fantôme","type":"response"},"213":{"next_id":"292","type":"goto"},"216":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"217","type":"mutation"},"217":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"218","type":"mutation"},"218":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"vampire 40 20 0.7\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"219","type":"mutation"},"219":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasMeetVampire","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"226","next_id":"220","next_id_after":"226","type":"condition"},"22":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"tea 30 25 0.35\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_item","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"23","type":"mutation"},"220":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"221","replacements":[],"text":"Salut Léonnie ! T'en tire une tête !","type":"dialogue"},"221":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"222","replacements":[],"text":"Quelque chose te tracasse peut-être ?","type":"dialogue"},"222":{"character":"","next_id":"223","replacements":[],"text":"Vampire est un être compliqué, qui a tendance à ironiser et se moquer de tout.","type":"dialogue"},"223":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"224","replacements":[],"text":"Si tu as des moqueries, faisons une trève pour ce soir. J'ai de gros problèmes !","type":"dialogue"},"224":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"225","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai entendu kr kr. Euh pardon. Oui ? Que puis-je faire pour t'aider ? Kr kr.","type":"dialogue"},"225":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasMeetVampire\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"226","type":"mutation"},"226":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasVampireIndice","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"231","next_id":"227","next_id_after":"","type":"condition"},"227":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"228","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai besoin de te poser quelques questions, Fantôme a perdu la mémoire...","type":"dialogue"},"228":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"229","replacements":[],"text":"Oh bah je tombe des nues kr kr. Euh pardon. Oui ?","type":"dialogue"},"229":{"character":"","next_id":"230","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie soupire.","type":"dialogue"},"23":{"character":"","next_id":"24","replacements":[],"text":"Mmh, au bon goût de citrouille ! Sa tisane préférée.","type":"dialogue"},"230":{"next_id":"259","type":"goto"},"231":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"","next_id":"232","next_id_after":"","type":"condition"},"232":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"233","replacements":[],"text":"C'est vraiment dommage quelqu'un ait rajouté de l'ail dans la potion!","type":"dialogue"},"233":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"234","replacements":[],"text":"J'espère que tu sauras t'en sortir. Kr kr.","type":"dialogue"},"234":{"condition":{"lhs":"foundGarlic","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"true"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_id":"235","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["234","253","255"],"text":"Attends, de l'ail ?","type":"response"},"235":{"condition":{"lhs":"foundTruth","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"true"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"238","next_id":"236","next_id_after":"","type":"condition"},"236":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"237","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, bon, on en a déjà parlé... C'est moi qui ait manipulé ta potion...","type":"dialogue"},"237":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"238":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"","next_id":"239","next_id_after":"","type":"condition"},"239":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"240","replacements":[],"text":"Ben oui, forcément ! Avec de l'ail en plus...","type":"dialogue"},"24":{"character":"","next_id":"25","replacements":[],"text":"Cultivée à l'aide de la potion familiale, le goût est plus intense !","type":"dialogue"},"240":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"241","replacements":[],"text":"De l'ail, oui... C'est marrant, il s'est passé... Attends, quoi ?","type":"dialogue"},"241":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"242","replacements":[],"text":"Quoi, quoi ?","type":"dialogue"},"242":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"243","replacements":[],"text":"Je n'ai pas parlé d'ail.","type":"dialogue"},"243":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"244","replacements":[],"text":"Zut...","type":"dialogue"},"244":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"245","replacements":[],"text":"C'était toi, pas vrai ?","type":"dialogue"},"245":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"246","replacements":[],"text":"Peut-être...","type":"dialogue"},"246":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"247","replacements":[],"text":"Mais pourquoi as-tu fais ça ?!","type":"dialogue"},"247":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"248","replacements":[],"text":"J'aime pas l'ail, ça me fait tousser...","type":"dialogue"},"248":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"foundTruth\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"249","type":"mutation"},"249":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"250","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai voulu débarrasser Toussaint-Sainte-Peur de la terreur bulbeuse !","type":"dialogue"},"25":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"tea\""],"lhs_function":"remove_item","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"26","type":"mutation"},"250":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"251","replacements":[],"text":"Et en plus tu me fais porter le chapeau ! C'est pas très cool.","type":"dialogue"},"251":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"252","replacements":[],"text":"Oui bon... Désolé. Kr kr. Euh pardon. Réflexe.","type":"dialogue"},"252":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"253":{"condition":null,"next_id":"254","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Fantôme","type":"response"},"254":{"next_id":"292","type":"goto"},"255":{"condition":null,"next_id":"256","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Maire","type":"response"},"256":{"next_id":"131","type":"goto"},"259":{"condition":null,"next_id":"260","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["259","266","274"],"text":"Pourquoi t'as l'air si louche ?","type":"response"},"26":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasDrinkTea\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"27","type":"mutation"},"260":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"261","replacements":[],"text":"Boh alors Léonnie, c'est pas des choses qui se disent kr kr.","type":"dialogue"},"261":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"262","replacements":[],"text":"Mais ta façon de rigoler en faisant \"kr kr\" là, on dirait que tu te moques.","type":"dialogue"},"262":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"263","replacements":[],"text":"Mais non voyons. Ou peut-être que si ? Qui peut dire ?","type":"dialogue"},"263":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"264","replacements":[],"text":"Oh, bon. Je vois que cette conversation ne nous mènera nulle part.","type":"dialogue"},"264":{"next_id":"259","type":"goto"},"266":{"condition":null,"next_id":"267","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Tu penses quoi du Maire ?","type":"response"},"267":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"268","replacements":[],"text":"Il est rigolo.","type":"dialogue"},"268":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"269","replacements":[],"text":"Rigolo comment ?","type":"dialogue"},"269":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"270","replacements":[],"text":"Il a des avis arriérés et il fait semblant de pas s'en rendre compte.","type":"dialogue"},"27":{"next_id":"14","type":"goto"},"270":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"271","replacements":[],"text":"Je pense qu'il se ment à lui-même, ça le rend rigolo.","type":"dialogue"},"271":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"272","replacements":[],"text":"Je ne peux pas démentir...","type":"dialogue"},"272":{"next_id":"259","type":"goto"},"274":{"condition":null,"next_id":"275","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Hier soir","type":"response"},"275":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"276","replacements":[],"text":"Tu as vu quelque chose hier soir ? Il s'est passé quelque chose d'étrange.","type":"dialogue"},"276":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"277","replacements":[],"text":"Tu veux dire, plus que d'habitude ? Etrange comment ?","type":"dialogue"},"277":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"278","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, forcément... Tu sais que je ne rate jamais mes potions ?","type":"dialogue"},"278":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"279","replacements":[],"text":"C'est ce que j'ai entendu dire kr kr. Pourquoi ?","type":"dialogue"},"279":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"280","replacements":[],"text":"Ne fais pas semblant, tu sais ce qui est arrivé aux citrouilles, non ?","type":"dialogue"},"28":{"condition":null,"next_id":"29","next_id_after":"29","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir les citrouilles","type":"response"},"280":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"281","replacements":[],"text":"Ah, celles qui attaquent la ville ? Oui j'en ai entendu parler kr kr.","type":"dialogue"},"281":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"282","replacements":[],"text":"Allons Vampire, Halloween et Toussaint-Sainte-Peur sont en danger !","type":"dialogue"},"282":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"283","replacements":[],"text":"D'accord, d'accord... Quelqu'un a mélangé les ingrédients de ta potion !","type":"dialogue"},"283":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"284","replacements":[],"text":"Quoi ?! Comment tu le sais ?","type":"dialogue"},"284":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"285","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai vu une silhouette par la fenêtre de ton atelier !","type":"dialogue"},"285":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"286","replacements":[],"text":"Mais je ne saurais pas dire qui. Il faisait noir.","type":"dialogue"},"286":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasVampireIndice\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"287","type":"mutation"},"287":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"288","replacements":[],"text":"Ca fait sens. Quel gâchis. Je comprends que les citrouilles aient mal réagi !","type":"dialogue"},"288":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"289","replacements":[],"text":"Merci Vampire, l'énigme s'éclaircit !","type":"dialogue"},"289":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"29":{"next_id":"32","type":"goto"},"292":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"champ\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"293","type":"mutation"},"293":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"294","type":"mutation"},"294":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 30 20 0.6\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"295","type":"mutation"},"295":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"296","replacemen