elqu'un a manipulé la potion...","type":"dialogue"},"35":{"character":"","next_id":"36","replacements":[],"text":"Plus une courge à l'horizon !","type":"dialogue"},"350":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"351","replacements":[],"text":"Ooooh je suis désolé pour toi Léonnie...","type":"dialogue"},"351":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"352","replacements":[],"text":"Je sens que ce mystère est cousu de fil blanc. Je vais éclaircir tout ça.","type":"dialogue"},"352":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"353","replacements":[],"text":"Je crois en toi Léonnie !","type":"dialogue"},"353":{"condition":null,"next_id":"354","next_id_after":"358","replacements":[],"responses":["353","355"],"text":"Aller voir Maire","type":"response"},"354":{"next_id":"131","type":"goto"},"355":{"condition":null,"next_id":"356","next_id_after":"358","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"356":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"357":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"","next_id":"358","next_id_after":"","type":"condition"},"358":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"359","replacements":[],"text":"Non, toujours rien. Tu es sûr de ne rien te rappeler ?","type":"dialogue"},"359":{"character":"Vampire","next_id":"360","replacements":[],"text":"Non... Seulement de m'être évanoui à un moment... Mmh...","type":"dialogue"},"36":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"37","replacements":[],"text":"Ce n'est pas possible ?! Halloween est demain !","type":"dialogue"},"360":{"condition":null,"next_id":"361","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["360","362"],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"361":{"next_id":"216","type":"goto"},"362":{"condition":null,"next_id":"363","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Maire","type":"response"},"363":{"next_id":"131","type":"goto"},"366":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"367","type":"mutation"},"367":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville-citrouille\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"368","type":"mutation"},"368":{"character":"","next_id":"369","replacements":[],"text":"Dans la ville, certaines citrouilles colériques se sont rassemblées.","type":"dialogue"},"369":{"character":"","next_id":"370","replacements":[],"text":"Elle forment un seul et même gigantesque cucurbitacé !","type":"dialogue"},"37":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"38","replacements":[],"text":" Comment vais-je faire ?!","type":"dialogue"},"370":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"371","replacements":[],"text":"Oh non !","type":"dialogue"},"371":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"372","replacements":[],"text":"Il faut vraiment intervenir maintenant...","type":"dialogue"},"372":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"373","replacements":[],"text":"Sinon toute la ville va être rasée !","type":"dialogue"},"373":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"374","replacements":[],"text":"Heureusement, j'ai paré à toute éventualité !","type":"dialogue"},"374":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"375","replacements":[],"text":"Il faut que je choisisse judicieusement une potion qui puisse m'aider.","type":"dialogue"},"375":{"character":"Léonnié","next_id":"376","replacements":[],"text":"Je vais boire ma potion de...","type":"dialogue"},"376":{"condition":null,"next_id":"377","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["376"],"text":"Répartie","type":"response"},"377":{"next_id":"380","type":"goto"},"38":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 30 20 0.4\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"39","type":"mutation"},"380":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"381","type":"mutation"},"381":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"leonnie-rap-ending\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"382","type":"mutation"},"382":{"character":"","next_id":"383","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie sort son micro ensorcelée, et commence à balancer punchline sur punchline à Citrouillezilla !","type":"dialogue"},"383":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"384","replacements":[],"text":"\"T'es pas la citrouille la plus arrosée du champ, à ta place je ficherais le camp !\"","type":"dialogue"},"384":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"385","replacements":[],"text":"\"Marrant ta couleur, face de potiron. T'es orange parce que tu veux de l'attention !\"","type":"dialogue"},"385":{"character":"","next_id":"386","replacements":[],"text":"Citrouillezilla ne sait pas quoi répondre, elle se considère clashée !","type":"dialogue"},"386":{"character":"","next_id":"387","replacements":[],"text":"Elle s'effondre dans des hurlements infernaux.","type":"dialogue"},"387":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"388","replacements":[],"text":"C'était pas de la tarte, mais on en est venu à bout !","type":"dialogue"},"388":{"character":"","next_id":"","replacements":[],"text":"The end ~ ~","type":"dialogue"},"39":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"40","replacements":[],"text":"Oh là là...","type":"dialogue"},"4":{"character":"","next_id":"5","replacements":[],"text":"Sa spécialité ? Les potions !","type":"dialogue"},"40":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"41","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme, c'est toi ? Je t'en prie, as-tu vu quelque chose ?","type":"dialogue"},"41":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"42","replacements":[],"text":"Je... Je crois avoir...","type":"dialogue"},"42":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"43","replacements":[],"text":"Ah je ne sais plus!... Ma mémoire, elle disparait...","type":"dialogue"},"43":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"44","type":"mutation"},"44":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"45","replacements":[],"text":"Enfin, ce n'est pas le moment de me laisser tomber, reviens !","type":"dialogue"},"45":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 45 10 0.6\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"46","type":"mutation"},"46":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"47","replacements":[],"text":"Je... J'ai vu... Enfin... Il faisait nuit...","type":"dialogue"},"47":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"48","replacements":[],"text":"(Un jour, j'en ferais ma taie d'oreiller)","type":"dialogue"},"48":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"49","replacements":[],"text":"Si je ne trouve pas de solution, je devrais me trouver un nouvel endroit où vivre !","type":"dialogue"},"49":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"50","replacements":[],"text":"Ce jour là, Fantôme, tu pourras dire adieu à l'adoucissant !","type":"dialogue"},"5":{"character":"","next_id":"6","replacements":[],"text":"Sur son petit cottage, se dresse une maison à pattes de poules, ainsi qu'un champ de citrouilles.","type":"dialogue"},"50":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"51","type":"mutation"},"51":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 35 20 0.70\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"52","type":"mutation"},"52":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"53","replacements":[],"text":"Très bien, très bien ! Tout ce dont je me rappelle...","type":"dialogue"},"53":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"54","replacements":[],"text":"C'est comme si tes citrouilles avaient pris vie, et s'étaient enfuies !","type":"dialogue"},"54":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"55","replacements":[],"text":"Quoi ?! Comment ça ? Mais où sont-elles allées ?","type":"dialogue"},"55":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"56","replacements":[],"text":"C'est pas moi...","type":"dialogue"},"56":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"57","type":"mutation"},"57":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"58","replacements":[],"text":"Voyons, ne te froisse pas ! Dis moi simplement où les trouver.","type":"dialogue"},"58":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome 35 20 0.70\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"59","type":"mutation"},"59":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"60","replacements":[],"text":"Elles sont allées vers la ville... Il me semble ?","type":"dialogue"},"6":{"character":"","next_id":"7","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie est très fière de ses citrouilles.","type":"dialogue"},"60":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"61","replacements":[],"text":"J'aimerais t'aider plus, je te jure ! Seulement ma mémoire...","type":"dialogue"},"61":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"fantome\""],"lhs_function":"remove_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"62","type":"mutation"},"62":{"character":"Fantôme","next_id":"63","replacements":[],"text":"C'est comme si elle s'effaçait.","type":"dialogue"},"63":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"64","replacements":[],"text":"Nous voilà dans de beaux draps... Mais qu'est-ce qui cloche à la fin ?","type":"dialogue"},"64":{"condition":null,"next_id":"65","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["64","77","79"],"text":"Inspecter le champ","type":"response"},"65":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"66","replacements":[],"text":"Peut-être qu'il reste quelque chose sur place qui pourrait m'éclairer !","type":"dialogue"},"66":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"67","replacements":[],"text":"Certaines citrouilles n'ont pas bougé... Ca me fera des graines et de la tisane, au moins !","type":"dialogue"},"67":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"68","replacements":[],"text":"Tiens, c'est bizarre...","type":"dialogue"},"68":{"character":"","next_id":"69","replacements":[],"text":"Une citrouille semblant s'être déplacée, n'est cependant pas arrivée en ville.","type":"dialogue"},"69":{"character":"","next_id":"70","replacements":[],"text":"Dégagée de ses racines, elle a l'air d'avoir mordu un...","type":"dialogue"},"7":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"salon\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"8","type":"mutation"},"70":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"71","replacements":[],"text":"...mouchoir ? Mais qu'est-ce qu'un mouchoir fait ici ?!","type":"dialogue"},"71":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"72","replacements":[],"text":"Il est brodé, mais je ne reconnais pas la signature.","type":"dialogue"},"72":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"73","replacements":[],"text":"Il est tâché... Tiens, ça sent l'ail ? C'est bizarre.","type":"dialogue"},"73":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"foundGarlic\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"74","type":"mutation"},"74":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"75","replacements":[],"text":"Brave citrouille, tu as voulu défendre le champ ? Quelle mauvaise graine a piqué les autres...","type":"dialogue"},"75":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"76","replacements":[],"text":"Allons voir ça de plus près !","type":"dialogue"},"76":{"next_id":"105","type":"goto"},"77":{"condition":null,"next_id":"78","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller en ville","type":"response"},"78":{"next_id":"105","type":"goto"},"79":{"condition":null,"next_id":"80","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Inspecter le chaudron","type":"response"},"8":{"character":"","next_id":"9","replacements":[],"text":"Buvant une infusion de ses cucurbitacés préférés, elle se prépare à sortir voir son potager.","type":"dialogue"},"80":{"character":"","next_id":"81","replacements":[],"text":"Il ne semble pas à Léonnie avoir raté la recette mais...","type":"dialogue"},"81":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"82","replacements":[],"text":"Mieux vaut vérifier deux fois, pas vrai ?","type":"dialogue"},"82":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"salon\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"83","type":"mutation"},"83":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"84","replacements":[],"text":"Le chaudron est telle que je l'ai laissé.","type":"dialogue"},"84":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"85","replacements":[],"text":"Peut-être que cela vient d'ailleurs ?","type":"dialogue"},"85":{"condition":null,"next_id":"86","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["85","94"],"text":"Inspecter le sol","type":"response"},"86":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"foundGarlic\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"87","type":"mutation"},"87":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"88","replacements":[],"text":"Mais, il y a une étiquette, là !","type":"dialogue"},"88":{"character":"","next_id":"89","replacements":[],"text":"Sur l'étiquette, est écrit \"Ail\"...","type":"dialogue"},"89":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"90","replacements":[],"text":"Quelqu'un a imité mon écriture ? Ca veut dire que j'ai échangé un des ingrédients !","type":"dialogue"},"9":{"character":"","next_id":"10","replacements":[],"text":"Ayant répandu la veille sa fameuse potion revigorante pour citrouille, elle a hâte de voir le résultat.","type":"dialogue"},"90":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"91","replacements":[],"text":"J'imagine que j'ai du mettre autre chose à la place de l'ail.","type":"dialogue"},"91":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"92","replacements":[],"text":"Les citrouilles n'ont pas apprécié ! Quel cauchemar, et Halloween qui approche.","type":"dialogue"},"92":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"93","replacements":[],"text":"Je ne sais pas qui m'a joué ce tour, mais il va voir de quoi se chauffe une sorcière !","type":"dialogue"},"93":{"next_id":"105","type":"goto"},"94":{"condition":null,"next_id":"95","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Inspecter l'étagère","type":"response"},"95":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"foundGarlic\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"96","type":"mutation"},"96":{"character":"","next_id":"97","replacements":[],"text":"Tous les ingrédients semblent impecablement rangés sur l'étagère.","type":"dialogue"},"97":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"98","replacements":[],"text":"Tous... Sauf ce pot !","type":"dialogue"},"98":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"99","replacements":[],"text":"Il n'est pas rangé à sa place. De l'oignon en poudre ?","type":"dialogue"},"99":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"100","replacements":[],"text":"Je n'en ai pas besoin pour la recette. Il était à la place de...","type":"dialogue"}},"titles":{"01 Start":"2","02 Waiting":"14","03 Pumpkins":"32","04 Before City":"105","04 City":"111","05 Fantome":"292","05 Maire":"131","05 QuestionsMaire":"162","05 Vampire":"216","05 Vampire questions":"259","07 Choix Potion":"366","08 Combat Final Rap":"380"}}